The source catalogues under releases/ contain URLs and planning metadata
only. A release bundle that quotes excerpts of official publications of the
Swiss Confederation, the cantons or municipalities reproduces those texts as
cited evidence with their source URLs and access times; they remain the
property of their publishers and are not relicensed under the Apache
License. Consult the publishers' terms of use before redistributing them.

The place register under config/places/ is derived from the register of
municipalities of the Federal Statistical Office (Amtliches
Gemeindeverzeichnis), read from its public API; the URL, access date and
hash of the response are recorded in the file.
